There are <span id="S1.F1.pic1.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000B3;">four</span> planes visible in the image. 
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="S1.F1.pic1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">VaPR</span> Response:<span id="S1.F1.pic1.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> There are <span id="S1.F1.pic1.1.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">six</span> planes visible in the image.
