It is <span id="A2.SS2.SSS4.pic2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000B3;">nighttime</span> in the image, as evidenced by the <span id="A2.SS2.SSS4.pic2.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000B3;">dark</span> sky background.</span></span></span>
