<span id="A2.SS2.SSS4.pic3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:33.53em;">
<span id="A2.SS2.SSS4.pic3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.SSS4.pic3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Hard-negative Rejected Response:<span id="A2.SS2.SSS4.pic3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> It is <span id="A2.SS2.SSS4.pic3.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">twilight</span> in the image, as evidenced by the <span id="A2.SS2.SSS4.pic3.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">darkening</span> sky background.</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A2.F13.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 13</span>: </span><span id="A2.F13.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Example prompt and generated hard-negative for <span id="A2.F13.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">VaPR</span> sample of background task category. Notably, the slight linguistic change from "dark" to "darkening" has significant change in semantics.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
