<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A2.F15.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 15</span>: </span><span id="A2.F15.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Example prompt and generated hard-negative for <span id="A2.F15.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">VaPR</span> sample of counting task category. Here, the penalty list is simulated for illustration. New counts represent additional information generated alongside the hard-negative rejected response to maintain the penalty list. Similar to color task category, We maintain a list of most perturbed count values (size 2), updated after every 10 hard-negative rejected response generations. Note, if more than one count is perturbed, "New Counts" will have more elements in the list.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
