<section id="A2.SS2.SSS6" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">B.2.6 </span>Spatial Reasoning</h4>

<figure id="A2.F17" class="ltx_table ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure ltx_flex_table">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><img src="2510.01700v1/images/prompt_images/spatial/spatial_prompt_ex.jpg" id="A2.SS2.SSS6.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:192/256;" width="192" height="256" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.SS2.SSS6.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel" height="324.47" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 324.47" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,324.47) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000080;" fill="#000080" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.32 L 0 319.15 C 0 322.09 2.38 324.47 5.32 324.47 L 472.06 324.47 C 474.99 324.47 477.38 322.09 477.38 319.15 L 477.38 5.32 C 477.38 2.38 474.99 0 472.06 0 L 5.32 0 C 2.38 0 0 2.38 0 5.32 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F5F5F5;" fill="#F5F5F5" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.38 5.32 L 1.38 319.15 C 1.38 321.33 3.15 323.09 5.32 323.09 L 472.06 323.09 C 474.23 323.09 475.99 321.33 475.99 319.15 L 475.99 5.32 C 475.99 3.15 474.23 1.38 472.06 1.38 L 5.32 1.38 C 3.15 1.38 1.38 3.15 1.38 5.32 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 6.7 9.39)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:33.53em;--ltx-fo-height:22.29em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="311.07" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 308.38)" width="463.96"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS2.SSS6.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:33.53em;">
<span id="A2.SS2.SSS6.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.SSS6.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Prompt:<span id="A2.SS2.SSS6.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break">You are a ResponseEditorGPT who is given an instruction and a response generated by a vision-language model. The instruction asks about the "spatial relation", of objects. Your task is as follows: 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span></span>
<span id="A2.SS2.SSS6.pic1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.SSS6.pic1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">1. Modify the "spatial relation" of objects to make the "Original Response" about the "spatial relation" incorrect. 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A2.SS2.SSS6.pic1.1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.SSS6.pic1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">2. "New Response" must be linguistically very similar to "Original Response" and must be incorrect.
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A2.SS2.SSS6.pic1.1.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.SSS6.pic1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">3. You must ensure changes must be realistic given world knowledge. 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A2.SS2.SSS6.pic1.1.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.SSS6.pic1.1.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">4. You can minimally change other spans of the sentence to grammatical correctness and fluency.
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A2.SS2.SSS6.pic1.1.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.SSS6.pic1.1.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">5. The output format should be "New Response:" 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A2.SS2.SSS6.pic1.1.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.SSS6.pic1.1.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Instruction:<span id="A2.SS2.SSS6.pic1.1.7.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Where is the toilet located in the image? 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span></span>
<span id="A2.SS2.SSS6.pic1.1.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.SSS6.pic1.1.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Original Response:<span id="A2.SS2.SSS6.pic1.1.8.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> The toilet is located outdoors, surrounded by a field of grass and trees, in the middle of the woods. 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span></span>
<span id="A2.SS2.SSS6.pic1.1.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.SSS6.pic1.1.9.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Your Turn 
<br class="ltx_break">New Response:</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.SS2.SSS6.pic2" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel" height="92.13" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 92.13" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,92.13) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000080;" fill="#000080" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.32 L 0 86.81 C 0 89.74 2.38 92.13 5.32 92.13 L 472.06 92.13 C 474.99 92.13 477.38 89.74 477.38 86.81 L 477.38 5.32 C 477.38 2.38 474.99 0 472.06 0 L 5.32 0 C 2.38 0 0 2.38 0 5.32 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F5F5F5;" fill="#F5F5F5" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.38 5.32 L 1.38 86.81 C 1.38 88.98 3.15 90.74 5.32 90.74 L 472.06 90.74 C 474.23 90.74 475.99 88.98 475.99 86.81 L 475.99 5.32 C 475.99 3.15 474.23 1.38 472.06 1.38 L 5.32 1.38 C 3.15 1.38 1.38 3.15 1.38 5.32 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 6.7 9.39)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:33.53em;--ltx-fo-height:5.49em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="78.72" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 76.03)" width="463.96"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
