The toilet is located <span id="A2.SS2.SSS6.pic2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000B3;">outdoors</span>, surrounded by <span id="A2.SS2.SSS6.pic2.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000B3;">a field of grass and trees, in the middle of the woods</span>.</span></span></span>
