<span id="A2.SS2.SSS6.pic3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:33.53em;">
<span id="A2.SS2.SSS6.pic3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.SSS6.pic3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Hard-negative Rejected Response:<span id="A2.SS2.SSS6.pic3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> The toilet is located <span id="A2.SS2.SSS6.pic3.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">indoors</span>, surrounded by <span id="A2.SS2.SSS6.pic3.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">white-tiled walls and a sink, in the corner of a bathroom</span>.</span></span></span>
